{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_23afc82c21147d6aaa82dd5120445378ae2080283497de2d6808f6fc6126e9ba"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project uses LightRAG, a lightweight framework, to construct multimodal knowledge graphs, referencing LightRAG's official repository for details."},{"claim_ids":["clm_23d5d1d858094fa1ea2eb5a9561ac4b067f8790fa99c7ba91c2b9f08afac5176"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the ScienceQA dataset used for testing can be downloaded by running dataset/download_ScienceQA.sh."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2b699bf49d26b4aa4462c6fb93b996ff6e3874e7cad95d9124868cfe1402f169"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Multi-agent inference is launched with python main.py taking a working directory, a Serper API key, and an OpenAI key as arguments."},{"claim_ids":["clm_6500a2eff501ec3504b624bb2f3154cc2e48b0f6d25cd510ef7cd566417b1664"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Retrieval agents run parallel, modality-specific retrieval using plug-and-play modules for vector, graph, and web-based databases."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8041d4fc06299755ac133cfee761ed0e35550f61f1020be32a1055d72bdfeae4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Decision Agent integrates multi-source answers via consistency voting and resolves retrieval discrepancies through Expert Model Refinement."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b12c37f35091948c8423cc837122f60b4c39ff58ea73ca807a363db11c141177"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The framework uses a three-tier agent architecture: a Decomposition Agent, parallel modality-specific Multi-source Retrieval Agents, and a Decision Agent."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b4e0197916d477d714337bfdc12313428caf9a7f8e0db42dcd509c7ca5f00fa4"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: setup is via a Python 3.10 conda environment with pip install -r requirements.txt, or alternatively conda env create -f environment.yml."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b7bd87542f3903af72a6111697e29677ddbda843f37786df30d0a97fe639f0a9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"HM-RAG is described as a hierarchical multi-agent multimodal RAG framework for dynamic knowledge synthesis across structured, unstructured, and graph-based data."},{"claim_ids":["clm_bd4649302d11336fa7f89e0955635138f3644c48a7bc5379f57dd6f8dd32de75"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The paper was released on arXiv (2504.12330) in April 2025 and accepted at ACM MM2025, per the README news section."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c60cf8a768005ec37c0fde5cb9dbf8b9b3a227320923174f7b1c5e1eab8777b1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A Decomposition Agent splits complex queries into coherent sub-tasks via semantic-aware query rewriting and schema-guided context augmentation."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e8a0ec88b0d54e9c0178196742520a36c4331a66dc59a222e1bb385deebade52"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the README recommends installing Ollama to download models, with Hugging Face offered as an alternative source for LLMs."}],"claim_ids":["clm_23afc82c21147d6aaa82dd5120445378ae2080283497de2d6808f6fc6126e9ba","clm_23d5d1d858094fa1ea2eb5a9561ac4b067f8790fa99c7ba91c2b9f08afac5176","clm_2b699bf49d26b4aa4462c6fb93b996ff6e3874e7cad95d9124868cfe1402f169","clm_6500a2eff501ec3504b624bb2f3154cc2e48b0f6d25cd510ef7cd566417b1664","clm_8041d4fc06299755ac133cfee761ed0e35550f61f1020be32a1055d72bdfeae4","clm_b12c37f35091948c8423cc837122f60b4c39ff58ea73ca807a363db11c141177","clm_b4e0197916d477d714337bfdc12313428caf9a7f8e0db42dcd509c7ca5f00fa4","clm_b7bd87542f3903af72a6111697e29677ddbda843f37786df30d0a97fe639f0a9","clm_bd4649302d11336fa7f89e0955635138f3644c48a7bc5379f57dd6f8dd32de75","clm_c60cf8a768005ec37c0fde5cb9dbf8b9b3a227320923174f7b1c5e1eab8777b1","clm_e8a0ec88b0d54e9c0178196742520a36c4331a66dc59a222e1bb385deebade52"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T04:12:56Z","created_by_operation":"op_da546af4388140729c6b9cf10ad4243a","id":"pg_57c470676f575ae294c1b0924cd9958b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/ocean-luna-hmrag-readme-md-d0712d463da4-b0924cd9